# Unicode segmentation in the text box (text::segment, UAX #29 / #14): the caret moves over
# grapheme clusters, Backspace deletes an emoji sequence whole but only the last code point of
# other clusters, Ctrl+arrows jump over words (apostrophes and numbers inside a word), a
# double click selects a word or a run of punctuation, wrapped boxes break lines after hyphens
# and between ideographs (UAX #14).  The first text has "e" + U+0301, a ZWJ family and two flags.
size 900 1200
theme light
click #700
type "Café 👨‍👩‍👧 🇩🇪🇫🇷"
expect #700 value 42
# Café: C a f e+U+0301 (6 bytes); the space; the family (18); the space; two flags (8 each)
key home right right right right
expect #700 value 6
key right right
expect #700 value 25
key right right
expect #700 value 34
key right
expect #700 value 42
key left left
expect #700 value 26
# Backspace after the family deletes it whole
key left
expect #700 value 25
key backspace
expect #700 text "Café  🇩🇪🇫🇷"
expect #700 value 7
# Backspace after e + U+0301 takes the accent only; typing it again restores the cluster
key left
key backspace
expect #700 text "Cafe  🇩🇪🇫🇷"
type "́"
expect #700 text "Café  🇩🇪🇫🇷"
expect #700 value 6
# Delete removes the next cluster whole: a flag
key end left left delete
expect #700 text "Café  🇫🇷"
# words: an apostrophe and a decimal number stay inside a word
key ctrl+a
type "can't stop 3.14 now"
key home ctrl+right
expect #700 value 6
key ctrl+right
expect #700 value 11
key ctrl+right
expect #700 value 16
key ctrl+left ctrl+left
expect #700 value 6
key ctrl+shift+right
key ctrl+c
key end
key ctrl+v
expect #700 text "can't stop 3.14 nowstop "
# a double click on punctuation selects the whole run (the dots of "abc...def": x 60)
key ctrl+a
type "abc...def"
wait 600
dblclick 60,564
key ctrl+x
expect #700 text "abcdef"
# wrapping (the box with TB_WRAP): after the hyphen of a long compound, between ideographs
size 900 3200
click #7961
key ctrl+a
type "Donaudampfschifffahrts-Gesellschaftskapitän 日本語の文章は空白なしで折り返されます"
shot build/segment_wrap.png 330 2820 260 150
expect_nowarn
